{"content_hash": "db22138a6356b771", "version_id": 723, "article_id": 73, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Paddy Power owner Flutter cuts 1,400 jobs over betting tax rises", "title_zh": "Paddy Power母公司Flutter因博彩税上涨裁员1400人", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "bbc_business", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqzrdpkm3g84o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567471945851-460fd29a04a2?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8cGFkZHklMjBwb3dlciUyMGN1dHN8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MjU0MDk0M3ww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by DANSHEN SOMINTAC on Unsplash", "author": "DANSHEN SOMINTAC", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@danshen?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/person-walking-on-corn-field-ncQT35ckj6o?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(133, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(171, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "b1b57f6a7576"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-21", "word_count": 174, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Flutter, the company that owns Paddy Power, is cutting up to 1,400 jobs. Its boss says the business cannot absorb the new taxes on gambling.", "lead_zh": "拥有Paddy Power的Flutter公司正在裁减最多1400个岗位。公司老板表示，企业无法承受新增的博彩税。", "preview": "Flutter, which also owns Sky Bet and Betfair, said the cuts will mostly affect staff in Leeds and Dublin. Workers in Portugal and Romania wh", "preview_zh": "同时拥有Sky Bet和Betfair的Flutter表示，此次裁员主要影响利兹和都柏林的员工。为英国和爱尔兰业务工作的葡萄牙和罗马尼亚员工也可能失业。不过，公司尚未说明哪些岗位面临风险。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 711, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/73/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 67.375, "size_bytes": 405648, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 204, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/73/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 68.15, "size_bytes": 410544, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 204, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/73/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/73/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 72.9, "size_bytes": 438912, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 204, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/73/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/73/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 62.525, "size_bytes": 376848, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 204, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/73/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/73/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 67.725, "size_bytes": 408096, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 204, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/73/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@42e9725/content/data/versions/723.json", "paragraphs": ["Flutter, which also owns Sky Bet and Betfair, said the cuts will mostly affect staff in Leeds and Dublin. Workers in Portugal and Romania who serve the UK and Ireland business may also lose their jobs. However, the company has not said which roles are at risk.", "The government raised taxes on online casino and sports betting in last year's Budget. Flutter boss Kevin Harrington said this had \"fundamentally changed\" the industry and helped the unlicensed market grow. He added that the company cannot absorb a rise of this size without cutting costs.", "A government spokesperson said the job cuts were a commercial decision for Flutter, although they understood it was a difficult time for workers. Flutter delisted from the London Stock Exchange in August, and its shares now trade only in New York.", "In the three months to June, Flutter reported a pre-tax loss of $299m worldwide. Sales rose 3% to $4.3bn, and revenue in the UK and Ireland grew by 4%. The restructuring plan will cost the company between $80m and $90m."], "paragraphs_zh": ["同时拥有Sky Bet和Betfair的Flutter表示，此次裁员主要影响利兹和都柏林的员工。为英国和爱尔兰业务工作的葡萄牙和罗马尼亚员工也可能失业。不过，公司尚未说明哪些岗位面临风险。", "政府在去年的预算中提高了在线赌场和体育博彩的税收。Flutter老板凯文·哈林顿表示，这“从根本上改变”了行业，并助长了无牌照市场。他还说，如果不削减成本，公司无法承受如此大幅的增税。", "一位政府发言人表示，裁员是Flutter的商业决定，但他们理解这对员工来说是一段艰难时期。Flutter于8月从伦敦证券交易所退市，其股票现在只在纽约交易。", "在截至6月的三个月里，Flutter全球报告税前亏损2.99亿美元。销售额增长3%至43亿美元，英国和爱尔兰的收入增长了4%。重组计划将花费公司8000万至9000万美元。"], "body": "Flutter, which also owns Sky Bet and Betfair, said the cuts will mostly affect staff in Leeds and Dublin. Workers in Portugal and Romania who serve the UK and Ireland business may also lose their jobs. However, the company has not said which roles are at risk.\n\nThe government raised taxes on online casino and sports betting in last year's Budget. Flutter boss Kevin Harrington said this had \"fundamentally changed\" the industry and helped the unlicensed market grow. He added that the company cannot absorb a rise of this size without cutting costs.\n\nA government spokesperson said the job cuts were a commercial decision for Flutter, although they understood it was a difficult time for workers. Flutter delisted from the London Stock Exchange in August, and its shares now trade only in New York.\n\nIn the three months to June, Flutter reported a pre-tax loss of $299m worldwide. Sales rose 3% to $4.3bn, and revenue in the UK and Ireland grew by 4%. The restructuring plan will cost the company between $80m and $90m.", "body_zh": "同时拥有Sky Bet和Betfair的Flutter表示，此次裁员主要影响利兹和都柏林的员工。为英国和爱尔兰业务工作的葡萄牙和罗马尼亚员工也可能失业。不过，公司尚未说明哪些岗位面临风险。\n\n政府在去年的预算中提高了在线赌场和体育博彩的税收。Flutter老板凯文·哈林顿表示，这“从根本上改变”了行业，并助长了无牌照市场。他还说，如果不削减成本，公司无法承受如此大幅的增税。\n\n一位政府发言人表示，裁员是Flutter的商业决定，但他们理解这对员工来说是一段艰难时期。Flutter于8月从伦敦证券交易所退市，其股票现在只在纽约交易。\n\n在截至6月的三个月里，Flutter全球报告税前亏损2.99亿美元。销售额增长3%至43亿美元，英国和爱尔兰的收入增长了4%。重组计划将花费公司8000万至9000万美元。", "text": "Flutter, which also owns Sky Bet and Betfair, said the cuts will mostly affect staff in Leeds and Dublin. Workers in Portugal and Romania who serve the UK and Ireland business may also lose their jobs. However, the company has not said which roles are at risk. The government raised taxes on online casino and sports betting in last year's Budget. Flutter boss Kevin Harrington said this had \"fundamentally changed\" the industry and helped the unlicensed market grow. He added that the company cannot absorb a rise of this size without cutting costs. A government spokesperson said the job cuts were a commercial decision for Flutter, although they understood it was a difficult time for workers. Flutter delisted from the London Stock Exchange in August, and its shares now trade only in New York. In the three months to June, Flutter reported a pre-tax loss of $299m worldwide. Sales rose 3% to $4.3bn, and revenue in the UK and Ireland grew by 4%. The restructuring plan will cost the company between $80m and $90m.", "vocab": [{"word": "absorb", "pos": "verb", "zh": "承受，吸收", "note": "常与成本、冲击等搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "restructure", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重组", "note": "指调整公司结构以节省成本", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "budget", "pos": "noun", "zh": "预算", "note": "此处指政府年度财政预算", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fundamentally", "pos": "adv", "zh": "从根本上", "note": "强调变化非常彻底", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unlicensed", "pos": "adj", "zh": "无牌照的", "note": "指未获官方许可的经营者", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spokesperson", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发言人", "note": "政府或机构的对外代表", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "delist", "pos": "verb", "zh": "退市", "note": "指公司股票从交易所撤出", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pre-tax loss", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "税前亏损", "note": "财务常用说法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "收入，营收", "note": "企业或政府的总收入", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mitigate", "pos": "verb", "zh": "减轻，缓解", "note": "常与影响、风险搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-21T00:02:22.121369", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Flutter", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.7, "sm": 300, "em": 699, "cs": 0, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": ",", "s": 0.7, "e": 0.74, "sm": 700, "em": 740, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "which", "s": 0.738, "e": 0.925, "sm": 737, "em": 925, "cs": 9, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "also", "s": 0.925, "e": 1.3, "sm": 925, "em": 1300, "cs": 15, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "owns", "s": 1.3, "e": 1.6, "sm": 1300, "em": 1600, "cs": 20, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Sky", "s": 1.6, "e": 1.875, "sm": 1600, "em": 1874, "cs": 25, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Bet", "s": 1.875, "e": 2.062, "sm": 1875, "em": 2062, "cs": 29, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "and", "s": 2.062, "e": 2.175, "sm": 2062, "em": 2174, "cs": 33, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Betfair", "s": 2.175, "e": 2.9, "sm": 2175, "em": 2900, "cs": 37, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": ",", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.025, "sm": 2900, "em": 3025, "cs": 44, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "said", "s": 3.025, "e": 3.163, "sm": 3025, "em": 3162, "cs": 46, "ce": 50, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "the", "s": 3.163, "e": 3.25, "sm": 3162, "em": 3249, "cs": 51, "ce": 54, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "cuts", "s": 3.25, "e": 3.538, "sm": 3250, "em": 3537, "cs": 55, "ce": 59, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "will", "s": 3.538, "e": 3.675, "sm": 3537, "em": 3674, "cs": 60, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "mostly", "s": 3.675, "e": 4.05, "sm": 3675, "em": 4050, "cs": 65, "ce": 71, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "affect", "s": 4.05, "e": 4.4, "sm": 4050, "em": 4399, "cs": 72, "ce": 78, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "staff", "s": 4.4, "e": 4.8, "sm": 4400, "em": 4799, "cs": 79, "ce": 84, "si": 